    "phase, running, queued. The oldest running request supplies label, session, prompt_tokens, prefilled, reused_tokens, generated, tokens_per_round, rounds, drafted, accepted, decode_tok_s, prefill_tok_s and elapsed_s. Chat completions also supply id.": "phase, running, queued. La solicitud en curso más antigua aporta label, session, prompt_tokens, prefilled, reused_tokens, generated, tokens_per_round, rounds, drafted, accepted, decode_tok_s, prefill_tok_s y elapsed_s. Las chat completions también aportan id.",
