    "ledger_used, ledger_budget, runtime (FLYX's CUDA runtime beside the ledger, where the system counts it), host_mapped (the K/V's host memory the resident figure misses), sessions (id, tokens)": "ledger_used, ledger_budget, runtime (el runtime CUDA de FLYX aparte del ledger, donde el sistema lo contabiliza), host_mapped (la memoria del host de la K/V que la cifra residente no incluye), sessions (id, tokens)",
